      "content": "wait... \"resolved and approved\"? what do u mean? if it was a blend at all then it's not single-origin and the boutique will crucify us if they find out. \n\ncan u just pull up the actual backend log for that batch one more time? i need to see the specific certification code and the timestamp of when that \"resolution\" happened. if i'm gonna sign off on this, i need to be able to tell the auditors exactly why we're calling it 100% tuscan. just paste the log line here pls.",
